                    {
                        "sense_id": "3393137a-24f1-3c62-905d-f4307c5306c9",
                        "entry_id": "0e5f7b85-b2f0-30d9-9697-7cfd2b0be8de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "уменьш.-ласк. к котёнок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2d7cc06-061c-4f22-8646-bac7424be22f",
                                "sense_id": "3393137a-24f1-3c62-905d-f4307c5306c9",
                                "text": "Соня приподнялась, и котёночек оживился, глазки заблистали, и он готов был, казалось, вот-вот взмахнуть хвостом, вспрыгнуть на мягкие лапки и опять заиграть с клубком, как ему и было прилично."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b03bfe3-2d6f-3061-864b-708658ecea29",
                        "entry_id": "0e5f7b85-b2f0-30d9-9697-7cfd2b0be8de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. употребляется как ласковое обращение к кому-либо (обычно к ребёнку)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "233abf2c-7b19-4f25-91a1-624e83befe69",
                                "sense_id": "0b03bfe3-2d6f-3061-864b-708658ecea29",
                                "text": "Муж закусит себе с аппетитом, да на вас и не взглянет, а скажет; поди-ка, дескать, на кухню, котёночек, да присмотри за обедом, да разве-разве в неделю разок поцелует, да и то равнодушно…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11fcdb4d-0329-42bf-8e73-06c6b80e7b99",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e5f7b85-b2f0-30d9-9697-7cfd2b0be8de",
                        "target_lang_word": "kitty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kitty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                        "entry_id": "4180ff05-ba1b-35ba-809e-c76b146baa6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young cat; a kitten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ef6aad1-d98b-4f41-b6cf-c0c4cad45d37",
                                                "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                                "text": "He said there was a beast with fangs in the alley, but it turned out to be a cute little kitty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95f11c90-88b4-4596-b4da-86c0cb6c7630",
                                                "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                                "text": "A pretty young Kitty, / She had that could Purr; / 'Tvvas gameſome and handſome, / And had a rare Furr; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3da45f96-cb9e-4ca3-bfb7-0aed1de3258f",
                                                "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                                "text": "Grandma-cats don't very often care for their grand-kittens. But I know two little Maltese kittens that have the nicest grandma that ever any little kittens had. […] The kitties are named \"Bill\" and \"May.\" They are good names. […] Of the kitties, you can't tell which is the prettier, however hard you try; and they are good kitties, as they ought to be, with a mamma and a grandma to take care of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dffcc00-58e6-49e6-a94a-c70997e30e56",
                                                "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                                "text": "Warm kitty, soft kitty, / Little ball of fur, / Sleepy kitty, happy kitty, / Purr! Purr! Purr!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9097d87a-bacd-4000-a84a-119db0e9dc08",
                                                "sense_id": "b72742af-5740-3422-8388-bf229e87f30f",
                                                "text": "To a child, a cat may look like a moving toy, so it's important to explain how delicate and sensitive a cat's body is from the very start. […] Even how a child picks up and handles the cat can make the kitty begin to fear the very sight of the youngster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d16df4a4-2664-3d95-ab98-797deb84f028",
                                        "entry_id": "4180ff05-ba1b-35ba-809e-c76b146baa6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adult cat; also (often childish), sometimes in the form Kitty: a pet name for a cat of any age."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "046d251b-e573-4460-b904-c5021f2bd394",
                                                "sense_id": "d16df4a4-2664-3d95-ab98-797deb84f028",
                                                "text": "Here, kitty kitty! Nice kitty!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36574f90-4122-35f0-88ab-4d0a33ca701b",
                                        "entry_id": "4180ff05-ba1b-35ba-809e-c76b146baa6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of pussy (“vulva and/or vagina”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc8b34e1-edd1-46d1-86d9-5fa979e77c94",
                                                "sense_id": "36574f90-4122-35f0-88ab-4d0a33ca701b",
                                                "text": "Looking at Lynn's naked body one last time, Mia decided to try something else. She waited for Lynn to bend down to grab her underwear and then came up behind her and began licking her kitty with long, wet strokes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f73d520-5ab4-40b2-9ded-fd1a32259bb3",
                                                "sense_id": "36574f90-4122-35f0-88ab-4d0a33ca701b",
                                                "text": "The way Tariq was licking her kitty had her clutching the sheets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b03972a9-3b78-4dc7-80cd-ca61701949e6",
                                                "sense_id": "36574f90-4122-35f0-88ab-4d0a33ca701b",
                                                "text": "Evan's tongue was magic. She'd heard most men didn't have the skills to make a girl lose her mind by licking her kitty. But Evan …"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kitty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
